{"metadata": {"file_suffix": "pdf", "producer": {"name": "mineru", "version": "4.0.0"}, "document": {"title": "about:blank", "languages": ["en-US"], "created_at": "2026-08-27T08:11:50+00:00", "modified_at": "2026-08-27T08:11:50+00:00", "creator_application": "Mozilla/5.0 (X11; Linux x86_64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) HeadlessChrome/149.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "producer_application": "Skia/PDF m149", "page_count": 3, "page_count_kind": "physical"}}, "extensions": {"mineru": {"tier": "basic", "parse_mode": "txt"}, "docvortex_layout": {"version": 1, "pages": [{"page_idx": 1, "width_pt": 595.9199829101562, "height_pt": 841.9199829101562}, {"page_idx": 2, "width_pt": 595.9199829101562, "height_pt": 841.9199829101562}]}}, "pages": [{"page_idx": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "text", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.044, 0.029, 0.947, 0.07], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "主观题/编程题评分可信度不足:设计 Think Tool 两段式评分——先让 LLM 自由推理评分依据，再将推理结论注入结构化评分 Prompt，并让模型自报置信度（<0.7 自动标记复核）。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.045, 0.076, 0.955, 0.116], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "单一评审维度难以支撑结构化、可解释的简历诊断:将简历评审拆解为六个独立维度并行调用 LLM 打分加权汇总，配合 Pydantic 结构化提取提升解析稳定性。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.044, 0.122, 0.947, 0.162], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "多业务场景下 Agent 复用与协作耦合问题:通过 Orchestrator + 独立 StateGraph 分层设计解耦四大业务逻辑，抽象\"单 Agent 直达\"与\"Pipeline 串联\"两种统一执行模式。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.044, 0.168, 0.962, 0.209], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "单点故障导致全链路不可用:设计三层容错（重试→Agent 降级→系统兜底）+ 滑动窗口裁剪与摘要压缩管理长对话记忆，避免上下文溢出与单环节异常拖垮整体链路。"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.036, 0.218, 0.129, 0.236], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "项目成果:"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.043, 0.247, 0.935, 0.265], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "通过多智能体架构，完成多功能整合，极大降低了教培机构的使用成本，教师和学生满意度达"}, {"type": "text", "content": "94%", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": "；"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.044, 0.272, 0.69, 0.29], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "系统成功覆盖并解决用户 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "92%", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的常见问题，实现高比例问题闭环处理；"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.044, 0.296, 0.921, 0.316], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "多智能体并行调度与流程优化使任务完成效率提升 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "28%", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": "，复杂问题查询请求处理速度加快近一倍。"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.036, 0.328, 0.168, 0.347], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "智答RAG系统"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.431, 0.329, 0.537, 0.347], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "核心开发者"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.792, 0.328, 0.962, 0.346], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "2025/07 - 2026/01"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.036, 0.352, 0.13, 0.369], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "项目背景:"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.035, 0.373, 0.958, 0.435], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "针对教培行业高频、重复性咨询问题（如课程安排、退费政策、学习规划等），传统FAQ匹配准确率低、知识更新滞后，难以满足用户实时精准答疑需求。为此设计并实现了一套融合结构化数据检索与RAG技术的智能问答系统——“智答”系统，显著提升回答准确率与用户体验。"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.036, 0.438, 0.13, 0.456], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "项目流程:"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.044, 0.466, 0.352, 0.484], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "文档预处理:加载、清洗、分块"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.044, 0.491, 0.62, 0.509], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "向量数据库构建:collection设计，field和index设计，数据插入"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 16, "bbox": [0.044, 0.516, 0.848, 0.534], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "高频问题缓存:MySQL高频问题存储与检索、Redis可靠问题存储与检索、FQA系统构建"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 17, "bbox": [0.043, 0.54, 0.85, 0.559], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "RAG检索系统:意图识别模块、策略选择模块、向量检索模块、答案生成模块、评估模块"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 18, "bbox": [0.036, 0.569, 0.131, 0.587], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "主要职责:"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 19, "bbox": [0.044, 0.597, 0.947, 0.637], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "主导系统整体架构设计，涵盖流程设计、组件选型、部署方案，构建文档处理→向量库→检索→生成全链路RAG系统"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 20, "bbox": [0.045, 0.644, 0.958, 0.684], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "设计多集合Milvus向量库（3个collections），基于BGE-m3实现稠密+稀疏向量存储；多模态文档加载器，完成清洗、分块，累计构建"}, {"type": "text", "content": "10", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": "万+条数据"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 21, "bbox": [0.045, 0.69, 0.857, 0.709], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "搭建MySQL+Redis二级缓存机制:MySQL存储高频问答对，Redis实现精确命中极速检索"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 22, "bbox": [0.045, 0.715, 0.934, 0.755], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "基于BERT训练意图识别模块（F1-score 92%），设计混合检索+ "}, {"type": "text", "content": "BGE-Reranker-v2-m3", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 重排序流程，并构建"}, {"type": "text", "content": "1000", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": "条标注测试集，使用RagAS完成全流程量化评估"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 23, "bbox": [0.045, 0.762, 0.457, 0.78], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "使用"}, {"type": "text", "content": "vLLM", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": "部署Qwen2.5-7B，实现高效推理"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 24, "bbox": [0.036, 0.79, 0.13, 0.808], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "项目优化:"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 25, "bbox": [0.043, 0.818, 0.916, 0.837], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "多模态增强:引入"}, {"type": "text", "content": "PaddleOCR", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": "+多模态大模型，提取PDF/PPT中图表信息，提升知识覆盖完整性"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 26, "bbox": [0.044, 0.844, 0.877, 0.862], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Query改写:设计HyDE、子查询分解、回溯问题等多策略改写机制，上下文召回率提升"}, {"type": "text", "content": "34%", "styles": ["bold"]}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 27, "bbox": [0.044, 0.868, 0.925, 0.887], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "检索优化:构建父子层级化索引，结合稀疏+稠密混合检索与reranker精排，Top-5相关性提升"}, {"type": "text", "content": "35%", "styles": ["bold"]}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 28, "bbox": [0.044, 0.894, 0.871, 0.912], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "模型微调:对Qwen2.5-7B进行LoRA微调，适配教育领域术语与回答风格，提升回答专业性"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 29, "bbox": [0.036, 0.922, 0.13, 0.94], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "项目成果:"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 30, "bbox": [0.044, 0.951, 0.585, 0.969], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "系统响应平均时效缩短 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "61%", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": "，极大降低了用户的等待时间。"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 2, "blocks": [{"type": "text", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.045, 0.029, 0.346, 0.047], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "系统上线后自动应答率超 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "80%", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": "；"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.044, 0.054, 0.559, 0.072], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "回答准确率与用户满意度显著提升，客户满意度达"}, {"type": "text", "content": "94%", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": "；"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.037, 0.086, 0.143, 0.104], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "AI医疗助手"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.432, 0.086, 0.536, 0.104], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "核心开发者"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.793, 0.086, 0.962, 0.102], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "2025/02 - 2025/06"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.036, 0.11, 0.13, 0.127], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "项目背景:"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.035, 0.131, 0.959, 0.214], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "传统线上医疗咨询服务存在响应不及时、分诊不精准、夜间或节假日服务缺失等问题。患者往往需要反复切换渠道才能完成「症状分析→科室推荐→流程咨询」的完整链路。本项目旨在通过大语言模型（LLM）与工作流引擎结合，构建一个7×24小时在线的智能医疗咨询系统，实现从用户输入到精准分诊的全自动化闭环，降低医院分诊台的人力压力，同时提升患者就医效率。"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.037, 0.217, 0.131, 0.235], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "主要内容:"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.045, 0.245, 0.96, 0.305], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "基于 Dify 编排六路分支工作流，意图识别 LLM 将用户输入分类为症状描述、就医流程、科室推荐、用药咨询、紧急信号、闲聊，路由至不同处理链路症状描述链路结合知识库检索（基础医疗指南）输出分诊建议；"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.045, 0.313, 0.953, 0.352], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "就医流程链路采用 LLM + 联网搜索双引擎；科室推荐链路实时查询数据库匹配科室与医生；用药链路严格拒绝建议并引导就医；"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.045, 0.359, 0.96, 0.398], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "急诊链路中断正常流程输出急救指引提示词工程覆盖 JSON Schema 约束、Few-shot 分类、角色设定与边界规则"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.044, 0.405, 0.787, 0.424], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "五重安全防线:禁诊断、禁用药建议、急诊中断、免责声明全覆盖、提示词硬约束"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.036, 0.434, 0.13, 0.452], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "项目成果:"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.045, 0.463, 0.411, 0.48], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "紧急信号零延迟响应，安全合规零事故"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.045, 0.487, 0.589, 0.505], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "低代码编排，业务变更仅需调整工作流配置，无需重新部署"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.037, 0.519, 0.162, 0.537], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "新闻标题分类"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 16, "bbox": [0.432, 0.52, 0.537, 0.537], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "核心开发者"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 17, "bbox": [0.793, 0.519, 0.962, 0.535], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "2024/07 - 2025/02"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 18, "bbox": [0.036, 0.543, 0.13, 0.56], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "项目背景:"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 19, "bbox": [0.035, 0.563, 0.944, 0.625], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "针对中文新闻标题10分类任务（金融/房产/股票/教育/科技/社会/政治/体育/游戏/娱乐），构建从传统机器学习→深度学习→大语言模型的完整技术路线，覆盖数据探索、特征工程、多模型训练评估、模型轻量化、Web服务部署全流程。"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 20, "bbox": [0.036, 0.628, 0.13, 0.646], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "项目职责:"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 21, "bbox": [0.045, 0.657, 0.937, 0.696], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "搭建三阶段模型迭代链路:随机森林+TF-IDF（F1 81.52%）→ FastText词级分类（F1 90.78%）→ BERT-base-chinese微调（F1 92.6%）"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 22, "bbox": [0.045, 0.703, 0.888, 0.721], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "使用阿里百炼LLM平台，构建含分类规则与Few-shot示例的System Prompt，实现零样本分类"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 23, "bbox": [0.044, 0.728, 0.78, 0.746], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "为各模型分别搭建FastAPI后端服务，配合Streamlit前端完成交互式分类演示部署"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 24, "bbox": [0.036, 0.756, 0.13, 0.775], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "项目成果:"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 25, "bbox": [0.044, 0.785, 0.726, 0.803], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "知识蒸馏方案效果最优:体积压缩93.5%，精度几乎无损，为最终落地方案"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 26, "bbox": [0.045, 0.81, 0.638, 0.828], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "完成量化（↓62.8%）与剪枝（30%）两种轻量化路径的横向对比"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 27, "bbox": [0.045, 0.835, 0.784, 0.853], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "设计LLM+Prompt少样本分类，验证Prompt Engineering在无标注场景下的可用性"}]}]}], "is_full_document": false, "schema": "docvortex.middle", "schema_version": "2.0"}